  "description": "TG1 - group of 6 lime trees 18m high and 6m wide, these trees have lapsed pollards, low crowns over the footpath and road and encroaching the building, we would like to reduce the hight by 4m leaving 14m high and width by 2m leaving 4m wide, also ensuring 2.5 clearance from the building, street furniture and footpath and 5m clearance from the road. T1- English oak, low crown over car park, we would like to raise the crown ensuring 3m clearance from the ground over the car park area only. T2 - Box elder, low crown over car park, we would like to raise the crown ensuring 3m clearance from ground level over the car park only. TG2 - Lawson cypress hedge, 7m high, we would like to reduce the hight by 2m leaving 5m high.",
